<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas says Marshall to step down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas says Marshall to step down.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Wednesday that Sir Colin Marshall, chairman of British Airways Plc, will step down from the Qantas board of directors.</p>
<p>He will be replaced by Robert Ayling, chief executive of the British carrier.</p>
<p>British Airways is a 25 percent shareholder in Qantas.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 61-3 92861421</p>
</text>
